+/* Temporary input-1 monitor-to-Wi-Fi-callback timing. The interrupted
+ * registers have already been saved, so this excludes hardware entry and
+ * monitor register-save time. Both direct and deferred delivery are sampled.
+ * C records completion at esp_int_adpt_cb, after the S-mode trap prologue.
