+/****************************************************************************
+ * arch/risc-v/src/esp32s31/esp32s31_pie.S
+ *
+ * SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2024-2026 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD
+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
